<title>USA: St. Paul to sell Minet group to Aon.</title>
<headline>St. Paul to sell Minet group to Aon.</headline>
<dateline>SAINT PAUL, Minn. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The St. Paul Cos Inc and Aon Corp said on Friday they entered into a definitive agreement to sell London-based broker Minet Group to Aon.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction, which was expected to close within the next several weeks, were not seen as material to either party and were not disclosed, the companies said.</p>
</text>
